    "http": "# v1 API — Generated from OpenAPI spec\n\n@host = http://localhost/api\n@token = Bearer {{token}}\n\n### Validates a literal, declares nothing\nPOST {{host}}/v1/things/validatesLiteral\n\n### Validates rules assembled at runtime, declares nothing\nPOST {{host}}/v1/things/validatesRuntime\n\n### Builds a validator through the facade\nPOST {{host}}/v1/things/validatorFacade\n\n### Builds a validator through the helper\nPOST {{host}}/v1/things/validatorHelper\n\n### Validates through a form request\nPOST {{host}}/v1/things/formRequest\n\n### Validates and says so\nPOST {{host}}/v1/things/declared\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\nname=\n\n### Validates and describes the fields at runtime\nPOST {{host}}/v1/things/declaredDynamically\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\n\nname=\n\n### Takes nothing\nGET {{host}}/v1/things/takesNothing\n\n### Takes nothing either\nGET {{host}}/v1/things/onlyMentionsInComment\n",
    "markdown": "# Undeclared Input API (v1)\n\nActions that validate fields the markup never mentions — and the ones that\nmust not be reported.\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost/api`\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [things](#things)\n\n## things\n\n### Validates a literal, declares nothing\n\n`POST /v1/things/validatesLiteral`\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n### Validates rules assembled at runtime, declares nothing\n\n`POST /v1/things/validatesRuntime`\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n### Builds a validator through the facade\n\n`POST /v1/things/validatorFacade`\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n### Builds a validator through the helper\n\n`POST /v1/things/validatorHelper`\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n### Validates through a form request\n\n`POST /v1/things/formRequest`\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n### Validates and says so\n\n`POST /v1/things/declared`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `name` | string | Yes | Name |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n### Validates and describes the fields at runtime\n\n`POST /v1/things/declaredDynamically`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `name` | string | Yes | Name |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n### Takes nothing\n\n`GET /v1/things/takesNothing`\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n### Takes nothing either\n\n`GET /v1/things/onlyMentionsInComment`\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n",
    "curl": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Undeclared Input API (v1) — cURL examples\n# Auto-generated from OpenAPI spec. Do not edit manually.\n\nBASE_URL=\"http://localhost/api\"\nTOKEN=\"${API_TOKEN:-}\"\n\n# Validates a literal, declares nothing\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/things/validatesLiteral\"\n\n# Validates rules assembled at runtime, declares nothing\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/things/validatesRuntime\"\n\n# Builds a validator through the facade\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/things/validatorFacade\"\n\n# Builds a validator through the helper\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/things/validatorHelper\"\n\n# Validates through a form request\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/things/formRequest\"\n\n# Validates and says so\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"name=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/things/declared\"\n\n# Validates and describes the fields at runtime\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"name=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/things/declaredDynamically\"\n\n# Takes nothing\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/things/takesNothing\"\n\n# Takes nothing either\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/things/onlyMentionsInComment\"\n",
